id=xiaomi_global_airdrop
name=Quick Share AirDrop for Xiaomi Global
version=v1.0.1
versionCode=101
author=Midori, Claude Opus 5.5
description=Lets Google Quick Share exchange files with Apple AirDrop on Xiaomi global ROMs with the Peach v2 Wi-Fi chip (e.g. Xiaomi 17 Ultra). Makes the bundled Quick Share Extension privileged and loads the AWDL-capable Wi-Fi firmware, driver and Wonder module. Forces the GMS flags that let Quick Share use it.
